      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Una fuerza inesperada arrastró la nave hacia estrellas desconocidas. Delante apareció un brillante planeta rojo.",
      "emotion_tag": "[tense]",
      "duration_ms": 7760,
      "sha256": "c39e1a451e915feb4b3ea47a2e950c740a8b1b0abc67f6b40331e1de08e84d0e"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P01_L007_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L007",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F03",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "language": "es",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "¡¿Qué está pasando?!",
      "emotion_tag": "[alarmed]",
      "duration_ms": 1360,
      "sha256": "a80e22205890df60bdab0ed72998efdfb467666bfc170ffb9d539a9aeabb153f"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P01_L008_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L008",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F03",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "language": "es",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_031",
      "role": "pirate_lizard",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",
      "text": "¡¿Qué nos está atrayendo?!",
      "emotion_tag": "[panicked]",
      "duration_ms": 1600,
      "sha256": "d1cd99f194074e826da785838bd5ec2b9d4d60e724eda44e76ceff3d388620c6"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P01_L009_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L009",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F04",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "language": "es",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "La nave aterrizó suavemente sobre una pirámide negra flotante.",
      "emotion_tag": "[relieved]",
      "duration_ms": 4400,
      "sha256": "ca11d2132229002c4b8af73f409b6f81d6587340aaee3456f2480afdcc7ac5c1"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P01_L010_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L010",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F05",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "language": "es",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Las puertas se abrieron. Mika entró en la oscuridad, donde lo esperaban criaturas extrañas y sonidos inquietantes...",
      "emotion_tag": "[ominously]",
      "duration_ms": 8240,
      "sha256": "fbd91c44546d7ddf498294bf7bf4f703798b5877c5b346fff393efdb4ad2587e"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P01_L001_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L001",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "language": "fr",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Dans l'espace profond, les amis comprirent que personne ne savait où aller ensuite.",
      "emotion_tag": "[uneasy]",
      "duration_ms": 4960,
      "sha256": "2ae02d70727614615e1761d9e5232aa739e334eb13d39c861d61f5d12d305ce1"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P01_L002_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L002",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "language": "fr",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Bubble ! Où devons-nous aller ? Montre-nous la route !",
      "emotion_tag": "[urgently]",
      "duration_ms": 3200,
      "sha256": "26716c4b015bae5e550bfaaee6d1792c48e405faf69fea902186a7b630baaf21"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P01_L003_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L003",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "language": "fr",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_031",
      "role": "pirate_lizard",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",
      "text": "Ces étoiles nous sont totalement inconnues...",
      "emotion_tag": "[uncertain]",
      "duration_ms": 2880,
      "sha256": "3464bc33c3753145ee9053736ec7fbcf1f089fbb8851076e08e94daf6e5cb5ea"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P01_L004_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L004",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "language": "fr",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "text": "Qu'allons-nous faire ?!",
      "emotion_tag": "[worried]",
      "duration_ms": 1520,
      "sha256": "07e7e49d12e5589a185eeb48ba4ee278f4e48bbbed54e2472739b84a946620fe"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P01_L006_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L006",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F02",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "language": "fr",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Une force soudaine attira le vaisseau vers des étoiles inconnues. Devant eux apparut une brillante planète rouge.",
      "emotion_tag": "[tense]",
      "duration_ms": 6880,
      "sha256": "0e63e0779f9ed6bf0ea8cb6b6fd5d9b18e0773f1ce2d03b556168f20052391c0"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P01_L007_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L007",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F03",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "language": "fr",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Que se passe-t-il ?!",
      "emotion_tag": "[alarmed]",
      "duration_ms": 1200,
      "sha256": "7f64a572557600e362b08f4665eca7c5859159cf1efee25d77e680f4ccca72f5"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P01_L008_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L008",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F03",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "language": "fr",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_031",
      "role": "pirate_lizard",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",
      "text": "Qu'est-ce qui nous attire ?!",
      "emotion_tag": "[panicked]",
      "duration_ms": 1440,
      "sha256": "9249241bb5246e7a40532dda600a0c24128d221164fcf01c6a8c72a4133bf52e"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P01_L009_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L009",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F04",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "language": "fr",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Le vaisseau se posa en douceur sur une pyramide noire en lévitation.",
      "emotion_tag": "[relieved]",
      "duration_ms": 4160,
      "sha256": "aa8ba5e376e2f4ecddf4f6aaef7f0002f67a7abbd173b19cf173f29f8dc8d2ee"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P01_L010_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L010",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F05",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "language": "fr",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Les portes s'ouvrirent. Mika entra dans l'obscurité, où l'attendaient d'étranges créatures et des sons effrayants...",
      "emotion_tag": "[ominously]",
      "duration_ms": 7520,
      "sha256": "fe1aef4cb61901c41deba6afd27d45b102ae2dd3e2028747c710ace419a14dca"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P01_L001_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L001",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "language": "de",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Im tiefen All merkten die Freunde: Niemand wusste, wohin sie als Nächstes fliegen sollten.",
      "emotion_tag": "[uneasy]",
      "duration_ms": 5760,
      "sha256": "6934a56fc46fbdd96aa0db908441787fc3d6945ccf67afd24eff9315e93988df"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P01_L002_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L002",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "language": "de",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Bubble! Wohin sollen wir fliegen? Zeig uns den Kurs!",
      "emotion_tag": "[urgently]",
      "duration_ms": 3440,
      "sha256": "95d423d187de5862aab1135fab7d5985e90ad8753eef3d491a384e0cfbd123bb"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P01_L003_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L003",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "language": "de",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_031",
      "role": "pirate_lizard",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",
      "text": "Diese Sterne sind völlig unbekannt...",
      "emotion_tag": "[uncertain]",
      "duration_ms": 2800,
      "sha256": "5b3cd43e84e771be5cd562b62d4119feecd6c5c9c951b0e9a337ec72b188bd8a"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P01_L004_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L004",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "language": "de",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "text": "Was sollen wir tun?!",
      "emotion_tag": "[worried]",
      "duration_ms": 1760,
      "sha256": "9d96fc2713ee7a4f9d92a70612fb51aa5c2e3ec4e93483d66648c527bb2197bb"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P01_L006_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L006",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F02",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "language": "de",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Eine unerwartete Kraft zog das Schiff zu unbekannten Sternen. Vor ihnen erschien ein leuchtend roter Planet.",
      "emotion_tag": "[tense]",
      "duration_ms": 7280,
      "sha256": "c663cce6dde66f7fe22f93ac3e1a08838671b0af93523fe45bba019e6125e46f"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P01_L007_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L007",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F03",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "language": "de",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Was passiert hier?!",
      "emotion_tag": "[alarmed]",
      "duration_ms": 1520,
      "sha256": "dbfb0dbe6bb4fdec46dbd0936113be63341464a03f0217491cbf150d2d6e7775"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P01_L008_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L008",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F03",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "language": "de",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_031",
      "role": "pirate_lizard",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",
      "text": "Was zieht uns hinein?!",
      "emotion_tag": "[panicked]",
      "duration_ms": 1760,
      "sha256": "a6bc07c12b93eb09a50acd6bea217a090359627eebeb57bb54dc5eb298baaf37"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P01_L009_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L009",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F04",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "language": "de",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Das Schiff landete sanft auf einer schwarzen schwebenden Pyramide.",
      "emotion_tag": "[relieved]",
      "duration_ms": 4240,
      "sha256": "fa3e776688d6d56fbade70580de89ea4e0451832da367086e22bd2c98049fbfc"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P01_L010_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P01_L010",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P01_F05",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "language": "de",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Die Türen öffneten sich. Mika trat in die Dunkelheit, wo ihn seltsame Wesen und unheimliche Geräusche erwarteten...",
      "emotion_tag": "[ominously]",
      "duration_ms": 7920,
      "sha256": "d4b9f17c589913d474a4e0069ca062a7526d5d4584ceccf9b733f95c1a4c13c7"
    }
  ],
